# backend/ is LOCKED

Do NOT create, edit, move, rename, or delete any file under `backend/`. Do not
refactor, reformat, change dependencies, or run/restart the backend service.

If a task seems to require a change in `backend/`, STOP and ask a human
maintainer first. Only proceed with an explicit human instruction that names
`backend/` and authorizes the specific change.

See `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for the full policy.
